 <h3><u>Alvidaa shehzada-e-Qasim</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Alvidaa shehzada-e-Qasim</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Alwidaa Shehzada-e-Qasim Alwidaa</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Saji Huwi Hai Karbala, Jaao Tumhe Allah Ko Sompa, Magar,</p> <p>Ab Kisse Kehke Bulaunga Mai Tasweer-e-Hassan</p> <p>Alwidaa Gulpairahan, Qasim-e-Tashna Dahan</p> <p>(Alwidaa Gulpairahan, Qasim-e-Tashna Dahan) x2</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Zainab-e-Khasta Jigar, Aur Kulsum-e-Hazeen</li>
    <p>Hoke Masruf-e-Bukaa, Ghash Pe Ghash Khaane Lagi</p>
    <p>Roke Kehti Hai Phuphi, Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Izne Dekho Na Akhi, Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Tu Sifarish Ke Liye Laaya Jo Tawiz-e-Hassan</p>
    <p>(Alwidaa Gulpairahan, Qasim-e-Tashna Dahan) x2</p>
    <li>Bhai Shabbar Ki Mere, Ik Nishaani Tum Ho</li>
    <p>Kaise Marne Ke Liye, Bhejdun Mai Tumko</p>
    <p>Tumhi Akber Ho Mere, Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Tumhi Lashkar Ho Mere, Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Sang Iss Dil Pe Rakhaa Phir Yeh Kiye Maine Sukhan</p>
    <p>(Alwidaa Gulpairahan, Qasim-e-Tashna Dahan) x2</p>
    <li>Dediya Izne-Wighaa, Thaam Ke Qalbo-Jigar</li>
    <p>Tum Bhi Hojaao Judaa, Ay Mere Nure-Nazar</p>
    <p>Jaao Hafiz Hai Khuda, Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Roke Sarwar Ne Kahaa, Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Alwidaa Tujhko Kahaa, Hone Lagi Dil Mei Chubhan</p>
    <p>(Alwidaa Gulpairahan, Qasim-e-Tashna Dahan) x2</p>
    <li>Maa Ke Armaan Hai Kya, Yeh Nahin Socha Kabhi</li>
    <p>Kya Hai Behnon Ki Dua, Yeh Nahin Socha Kabhi</p>
    <p>Tum Jo Marne Ko Chale, Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Zakhm-e-Dil Gehre Huwe, Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Bewaa Lagne Lagi Yeh Kehte Hii Ik Shab Ki Dulhan</p>
    <p>(Alwidaa Gulpairahan, Qasim-e-Tashna Dahan) x2</p>
    <li>Maardalega Mujhe, Teri Furqat Ka Yeh Gham</li>
    <p>Tu Suwe Dasht Na Jaa, Tujhko Sughra Ki Qasam</p>
    <p>Waqt Yeh Kaisa Padaa, Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Jo Ho Manzur-e-Khudaa, Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Dasht Se Laaunga Gathri Mei Tera Tukde Badan</p>
    <p>(Alwidaa Gulpairahan, Qasim-e-Tashna Dahan) x2</p>
    <li>Ban Mei Jab Jaaoge Tum, Yeh Toh Mujhko Hai Khabar</li>
    <p>Tan Se Kardoge Judaa, Arzaqe Shaami Ka Sar</p>
    <p>Hai Magar Yeh Bhi Yaqee(n), Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Tujhko Gheirenge Laee(n), Ay Mere Shere-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Haaye Hojaaega Paamaal Yeh Naazuk Sa Badan</p>
    <p>(Alwidaa Gulpairahan, Qasim-e-Tashna Dahan) x2</p>
    <li>Dashte Ghurpat Pe Mujhe, Sab Ke Sab Chhodgaye</li>
    <p>Aur Shahadat Ke Liye, Tum Qamar Bastaa Huwe</p>
    <p>Meri Mayyat Ke Liye, Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Chaar Kaandhe Na Rahe, Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Ab Yaqee(n) Hogaya Rehjaaunga Begoro Kafan</p>
    <p>(Alwidaa Gulpairahan, Qasim-e-Tashna Dahan) x2</p>
    <li>Dekh Maadar Ki Taraf, Kaisi Karti Hai Bukaa</li>
    <p>Aankh Mei Dajlaae Gham, Aur Honton Pe Sadaa</p>
    <p>Dekh Marjaaye Na Maa(n), Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Kaise Bhejun Me Wahaa(n), Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p>
    <p>Tu Jahaan Jaane Ko Kehta Hai Woh Hai Mawt Ka Ban</p>
    <p>(Alwidaa Gulpairahan, Qasim-e-Tashna Dahan) x2</p>
    <li>Roke Mazhar Ne Kahaa, Yeh Hai Irfan-e-Aza</li>
   </ol> <p>Jab Tasawwur Mei Gaya, Mera Dil Qaamp Uthha</p> <p>Kaise Maula Ne Kahaa, Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p> <p>Jaa Sue Dashte-Qazaa, Ay Mere Sher-e-Jawaan</p> <p>Aaj Bhi Rota Hu(n) Jab Honton Pe Aata Hai Sukhan</p> <p>(Alwidaa Gulpairahan, Qasim-e-Tashna Dahan) x3</p></font>
